#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_EnableWindowMask)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:23
msgid "Enable window shape mask"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, WindowMaskLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:30
msgid "If checked, the status bar and preedit bar window would have its shape mask. Some themes has non-rectangle shape, so enable shape mask can make the window be just the same shape as the theme pixmap is. However, shape mask feature may probably slow the whole application a lot. Please consider enabling window composite and background transparent instead if appliable."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_EnablePreeditResizing)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:52
msgid "Enable preedit bar realtime resizing"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, pushButton)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, pushButton_2)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, pushButton_3)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, pushButton_4)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:72 performance.ui:82 performance.ui:112 performance.ui:139
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Hülp"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, PreeditResizingLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:92
msgid "If checked, the preedit bar would resize itself whenever needed. However, realtime resizing may cost much resource for pixmap calculation and painting. If not checked, the preedit bar would resize itself using a certain content size strategy to reduce calculation and speed up painting."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_EnableBackgroundBlur)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:105
msgid "Enable background blur"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, BackgroundBlurLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:122
msgid "If checked, the background of preedit bar and status bar will gain blur effect so that it would be easier to tell apart the content on them. Besides, you would better enable background transparency and window shape mask to make this eye candy work properly and nicely. The blur effect may issue serious performance drawback on some graphics cards with certain driver. Do not check this option on if your system is that alike."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_EnableThemeAnimation)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:132
msgid "Enable theme animation"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, ThemeAnimationLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: performance.ui:149
msgid "If checked, the status bar and preedit bar will gain animation whenever the theme supports. Animations usually consume large resource while featuring cute eye candy."
msgstr ""

